  PASS  a newer request waits for the in-flight capture and persistence
  PASS  both distinct observations are persisted
  PASS  the newest observation is written last
  PASS  the newest maximised state is preserved
  PASS  an unchanged observation is deduplicated after persistence succeeds
  FAIL  a disposed capture cannot overwrite the replacement mount's geometry
  FAIL  disposal stops the remaining native reads and queued captures
  FAIL  a disposed saver ignores subsequent requests
